        "language": "english",
        "review": "After pouring hundreds of hours into an abandonware copy, and writing my own strategy guides, I am thrilled to finally pay money for this absolute gem of a game! This geopolitical simulator was truly ahead of its time in 1993, offering an open-ended global sandbox with you at the head of one of its major superpowers, and yet is still entirely relevant in the current political climate. Often you will need to play the long game to be successful, but you can truly let your ambitions run: will you intervene in the Middle East? be a peacemaker? conquer the Americas? or nuke everyone? Completing the simulator is the full 1990 CIA World Factbook, which fully immerses you into the alternate history you're creating. I hope one day it receives workshop support, because it has potential for sharing custom scenarios.",
